# The group that holds read access to the RAPL energy counters. It is
# deliberately not the exporter's own group: the packaged drop-in adds it
# to prometheus-node-exporter.service as a supplementary group, which works
# whatever User= that unit sets, DynamicUser=yes included.
# Type Name ID GECOS Home Shell
g rapl - -
